+        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.1-4">The relationship between BER and segment size is likely to vary depending on the error characteristics of the given channel.  This relationship deserves further study, however with the use of good forward error correction (see section 3.2) larger segments should provide better performance, as with any network <xref target="MSMO97" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="MSMO97"/>.  While the exact method for choosing the best MTU for a satellite link is outside the scope of this document, the use of Path MTU Discovery is recommended to allow TCP to use the largest possible MTU over the satellite channel.</t>
