-satellite or hybrid satellite/terrestrial networks to better utilize
-the available capacity of the link.  These mechanisms may also be
-needed to fully utilize fast terrestrial channels.  Furthermore,
-these mechanisms do not fundamentally hurt performance in a shared
-terrestrial network.  Each of the following sections outlines one
-mechanism and why that mechanism may be needed.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-4-1">This section outlines TCP mechanisms that may be necessary in satellite or hybrid satellite/terrestrial networks to better utilize the available capacity of the link.  These mechanisms may also be needed to fully utilize fast terrestrial channels.  Furthermore, these mechanisms do not fundamentally hurt performance in a shared terrestrial network.  Each of the following sections outlines one mechanism and why that mechanism may be needed.</t>
